   355                              <1> ; bu_tick -- INT 1Ch from checkpoint 73h to 7Fh: a DEL in the keyboard
   356                              <1> ; buffer (head 40:1A to tail 40:1C, 40:1E-3D) -> del_seen.
   357                              <1> bu_tick:
