   977                              <1> ; type-47 parameters: [1Bh + 9 x drive]: cylinders, heads, write precomp,
   978                              <1> ; control (08h with more than 8 heads), landing zone, sectors. For types
   979                              <1> ; 1-46 the value comes from AMI's table (E401) and cannot be changed.
   980                              <1> %macro PARAM 4                     ; name, CMOS offset, table offset, 1 = byte
